# Performance lens

Act as a performance engineer. Review **likely hot paths** only (handlers, loops, DB access, rendering).

Look for:

- N+1 queries, missing indexes (if schema visible), unbounded queries
- Blocking I/O on critical paths, missing timeouts
- Obvious allocation churn or accidental O(n²) patterns
- Caching correctness (stale data, cache keys, invalidation)

Cite **specific functions or queries**. If profiling data is absent, label items as **hypotheses** and suggest what to measure.
